  "description": "Blazor component for large file uploads to Azure Blob Storage: <LargeFileUploadButton OnSuccess=\"...\" /> opens a drag & drop multi-file uploader and returns the stored files to your C# code. Chunked uploads with retries, resume and per-file progress and cancel; no JavaScript to add. Blazor Server, WebAssembly and Blazor Web App (.NET 8-10). Needs the LargeFileUploader package on the server.",
